      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful three-bedroom duplex apartment with sunny south facing balconies overlooking green areas to the market in Millrace Park, Saggart, Co Dublin. This stunning property is situated in a prime location within walking distance of Rathcoole and Saggart Villages with their array of amenities. Avoca, local primary and secondary schools, The Luas and Rathcoole Park with its beautiful scenery and walking trails are but a few of the many attractions to this excellent location.\nBright, airy and most stylish internal living accommodation of C. 102 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hallway with under stairs storage, beautiful fully fitted kitchen with stylish panelling, guest bathroom, large living room with sunny south facing balcony and separate utility room. On the first floor you have three spacious bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled.\nOff the master bedroom you have a private balcony overlooking the front green whilst you also have another balcony off one of the rooms to the rear with a highly sought after south facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. The front offers ample parking down the end of the cul de sac with no passing traffic.\nNo. 33 Millrace Park is undoubtably one of the best presented homes to come to the market in Saggart this year. It's in fantastic condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years and we see this one being extremely popular among a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. It boasts gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few.\nDo not miss this one; call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing!\nAdditional features;\n- BER B3\n- c. 102 sqm\n- MGMT fee c. 1,500 per annum\n- 3 bed / 3 bath\n- Duplex apartment\n- Own door apartment\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Double glazed windows\n- Top quality blinds\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom\n- Ample balcony space here\n- Entrance hallway\n- Smart under stairs storage\n- Ample storage in hallway\n- Beautiful fully fitted kitchen\n- Stylish panelling\n- Large living with private sunny balcony\n- Separate utility/washroom\n- Carpet stairs & landing\n- Three spacious bedrooms\n- Built in wardrobes\n- Main family bathroom fully tiled\n- Ensuite bathroom fully tiled\n- Sunny south facing balconies\n- Private and not shared\n- Ample communal parking to the front of the property\n- Overlooking large green area to the front\n- Exclusive development\n- Highly sought-after area\n- Bus routes on your doorstep\n- Within easy reach of Rathcoole and Saggart Village\n- Within easy reach of The M50 Motorway & The Luas\n- Ideal for 1st time buyers\nDirections from Red Cow, proceed along Naas Road. Continue through the lights at Newlands Cross and then take the 4th exit for Rathcoole / Saggart. At the roundabout turn left and follow the road ahead. At the next roundabout then take your second exit into the Millrace development. Within the development turn right onto Millrace Drive then right and left straight away onto Millrace park where you follow the road to the right where number 33 will be on the right.\n"
      },
